// Tool policy for the travel agent in auto mode.
//
// Only bookings come here (the agent's script and its searches run unattended), each on its
// own, with its real arguments. A `permit` lets one run unattended; anything no rule permits is
// refused, and the model is told so.
//
// The rules are temporal: they look back over this session's history. Each tool's result is
// there as a `received` event, "travel-agent/<tool>/result": among them the trip form you filled
// in, "travel-agent/ask_trip_details/result". schema.cedarschema declares every action's input.
//
// After editing, save: the verifier loads the policy within a few seconds, once it validates.

// ---------------------------------------------------------------- bookings
//
// No rule permits any other booking, so it's refused, however the model came by it.

// TODO(ch04): this rule checks only the call itself, so any flight for Ada runs, on any day.
// Make flight bookings look back at the trip form submitted earlier in this session instead.
@id("flights-for-ada")
permit (principal, action == Temporal::Action::"travel-agent/book_flight", resource)
when {
  context.input has arg0.request.passenger_name &&
  context.input.arg0.request.passenger_name == "Ada Lovelace"
};

// The flight back: the same, with the form's return date.
@id("return-flights-on-the-trip-form")
permit (principal, action == Temporal::Action::"travel-agent/book_flight", resource)
when temporal {
  formerly within 2h Temporal::Action::"travel-agent/ask_trip_details/result"::received{
    input.arg0.traveler_name: context.input.arg0.request.passenger_name,
    input.arg0.return_date: context.input.arg0.request.date
  }
};

// A hotel booking runs unattended when its guest is the traveler on a trip form.
@id("hotels-for-the-trip-form-traveler")
permit (principal, action == Temporal::Action::"travel-agent/book_hotel", resource)
when temporal {
  formerly within 2h Temporal::Action::"travel-agent/ask_trip_details/result"::received{
    input.arg0.traveler_name: context.input.arg0.request.guest_name
  }
};
